{"ref":"BDB, שְׂבָם","hw":"שְׂבָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂבָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:3\" href=\"/Numbers.32.3\">Nu 32:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִֽׂבְמָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:38\" href=\"/Numbers.32.38\">38</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:19\" href=\"/Joshua.13.19\">Jos 13:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.8\">Is 16:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.32\">Je 48:32</a>; in Moab (Reuben), near Heshbon (cf. also Jerome <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.8\">Is 16:8</a>); Σεβαμα.","next":"BDB, שָׂבֵעַ","prev":"BDB, שְׂבָכִים"}